OL,3,A'Our babies are coughing': Life at
OL,4,Aepicentre of Indonesian wildfires
OL,5,Achoking Singapore and Malaysia
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC is on the ground in Indonesia's
OL,8,FCentral Kalimantan where burning
OL,9,Fpeatlands continue to blanket large
OL,10,Fparts of South East Asia in toxic smog
OL,12,FResidents in central Kalimantan say
OL,13,Fthey are afraid of the health risks but
OL,14,Fhave no choice but to endure them
OL,16,FThe haze has brought toxic air to
OL,17,FIndonesia, Malaysia, Singapore and
OL,18,Fparts of the Philippines for weeks now.
OL,19,FIn Indonesia alone, tens of thousands
OL,20,Fhave fallen ill
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
